  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "plane-dsh-plugin",
      "text": "[简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\n[](https://github.com/Bene-2020/plane-dsh-plugin/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[](LICENSE)\n\nA native [DeepSeek Harness (DSH)](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) plugin that quietly turns meaningful coding work into Plane project updates."
    },
    {
      "section": "plane-dsh-plugin",
      "text": "The plugin recognizes tasks, bugs, decisions, ideas, risks, milestones, plans, progress, and completions during an agent session. It writes events to a local SQLite outbox first, synchronizes them to [Plane](https://plane.so/) asynchronously, and exposes a global floating panel for inspecting and updating work items.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> This project is an early release. The storage and synchronization paths are extensively tested, but DSH and its external plugin APIs are still evolving."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- DSH-native Cordis host and browser client plugin in one installable bundle.\n- Eight agent tools for project discovery, binding, capture, and review.\n- Durable local SQLite outbox with idempotency, retries, leases, and crash recovery.\n- Asynchronous synchronization to Plane without blocking the main agent task.\n- Incremental active-item context instead of repeating a full project snapshot every turn.\n- Floating Plane-style panel with status filters, optimistic updates, and sync health.\n- Manual project switcher for DSH's global overlay, including duplicate-name disambiguation and stale-response protection.\n- Plane API keys resolved through DSH credentials and never written to the plugin database."
    },
    {
      "section": "Requirements",
      "text": "- Node.js 22.19 or newer.\n- pnpm available on `PATH` for DSH plugin management.\n- A recent `@deepseek-ai/dsh` release with external bundles, credentials, tools, client slots, and Typert remote support.\n- A Plane workspace and API key."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Install the prebuilt npm package into DSH's Web profile:\n\n```sh\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add plane-dsh-plugin\n```\n\nThe npm package already contains the host and browser bundles. Installation does not build this repository or require an `allowBuilds` exception."
    },
    {
      "section": "From a local checkout",
      "text": "Use this path only when developing the plugin itself:\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/Bene-2020/plane-dsh-plugin.git\ncd plane-dsh-plugin\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm build"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configure",
      "text": "Store the Plane key in DSH credentials, never in `cordis.patch.yml`:\n\n```yaml"
    },
    {
      "section": "$DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml",
      "text": "PLANE_API_KEY: \"your-plane-api-key\"\n```\n\nThen override the bundle row in `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` with your workspace slug:\n\n```yaml\n- id: plane-dsh-plugin\n  config:\n    workspaceSlug: your-workspace-slug\n    planeBaseUrl: https://api.plane.so\n    planeMode: sdk\n```\n\nStart DSH with the same profile:\n\n```sh\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh web\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "$DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml",
      "text": "The agent will offer Plane project binding when it first encounters an unbound working directory. The panel appears as a floating button in the DSH web UI. See [Configuration](docs/configuration.md) for every option and troubleshooting guidance."
    },
    {
      "section": "How it works",
      "text": "```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[DSH session events] --> B[Context and capture rules]\n  B --> C[Local SQLite outbox]\n  C --> D[Background worker]\n\nSee [Architecture](docs/architecture.md) for the design rationale."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm test\npnpm run test:coverage\n```\n\n`pnpm test` builds the workspace and distributable bundle, validates the packed artifact, and runs the full test suite. Client coverage is held at 100% for statements, branches, functions, and lines.\n\nUseful commands:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "| Command | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `pnpm build` | Build internal packages and assemble the public bundle. |\n| `pnpm test` | Build, verify the package contract, and run tests. |\n| `pnpm run test:coverage` | Run the coverage gate. |\n| `pnpm run pack:check` | Inspect the publishable tarball contract in a temporary directory. |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Privacy and security",
      "text": "- Source code, terminal output, and full transcripts are not stored by the plugin.\n- The Plane API key is resolved per operation through DSH credentials.\n- Local project metadata and the outbox are stored in SQLite at `~/.dsh/plugins/ambient-project/ambient.sqlite` by default.\n- Before reporting a vulnerability, read [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Contributing",
      "text": "Contributions are welcome. Read [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) and the [Code of Conduct](CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) before opening a pull request."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE) © 2026 Wenyan Wei."
    },
    {
      "section": "plane-dsh-plugin",
      "text": "[English](README.md)\n\n[](https://github.com/Bene-2020/plane-dsh-plugin/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[](LICENSE)\n\n一个原生的 [DeepSeek Harness（DSH）](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) 插件，在不中断 Agent 主任务的前提下，把有项目价值的编码工作同步到 Plane。\n\n插件会识别会话中的任务、Bug、决策、想法、风险、里程碑、计划、进展和完成事件，先可靠写入本地 SQLite Outbox，再异步同步到 [Plane](https://plane.so/)。DSH Web 中还会出现一个全局悬浮面板，用于查看项目状态和更新工作项。\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> 当前是早期版本。存储与同步链路已经经过完整测试，但 DSH 的外部插件 API 仍在快速演进。"
    },
    {
      "section": "主要功能",
      "text": "- 一个安装包同时提供 DSH Cordis host 插件和浏览器 client 插件。\n- 8 个用于项目发现、绑定、事件记录和审计的 Agent 工具。\n- 带幂等、重试、租约和崩溃恢复能力的本地 SQLite Outbox。\n- 后台异步同步 Plane，不阻塞当前 Agent 工作。\n- 增量注入活跃工作项，避免每回合重复完整项目快照。\n- Plane 风格悬浮面板，支持状态筛选、乐观更新和同步健康展示。\n- 面向 DSH 全局悬浮层的手动项目切换器，支持同名项目区分和过期响应隔离。\n- Plane API Key 通过 DSH credentials 读取，不写入插件数据库。"
    },
    {
      "section": "环境要求",
      "text": "- Node.js 22.19 或更高版本。\n- `PATH` 中可用的 pnpm，用于 DSH 插件管理。\n- 支持外部 bundle、credentials、tools、client slots 和 Typert remote 的较新 `@deepseek-ai/dsh` 版本。\n- 一个 Plane workspace 和 API Key。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "将预构建的 npm 包安装到 DSH Web profile：\n\n```sh\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add plane-dsh-plugin\n```\n\n该 npm 包已经包含 host 和浏览器 bundle。安装时不会构建本仓库，也不需要配置 `allowBuilds`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "从本地源码安装",
      "text": "仅在开发插件本身时使用这种方式：\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/Bene-2020/plane-dsh-plugin.git\ncd plane-dsh-plugin\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm build"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "把 Plane Key 放入 DSH credentials，不要写进 `cordis.patch.yml`：\n\n```yaml"
    },
    {
      "section": "$DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml",
      "text": "PLANE_API_KEY: \"your-plane-api-key\"\n```\n\n然后在 `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` 覆盖插件配置，填入自己的 workspace slug：\n\n```yaml\n- id: plane-dsh-plugin\n  config:\n    workspaceSlug: your-workspace-slug\n    planeBaseUrl: https://api.plane.so\n    planeMode: sdk\n```\n\n使用同一个 profile 启动 DSH：\n\n```sh\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh web\n```\n\n当 Agent 首次进入尚未绑定的工作目录时，会询问要关联哪个 Plane 项目。DSH Web 中会出现悬浮按钮。全部配置项和排障方法见[配置文档](docs/configuration.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "工作原理",
      "text": "```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[DSH 会话事件] --> B[上下文与采集规则]\n  B --> C[本地 SQLite Outbox]\n  C --> D[后台同步 Worker]\n\n详细设计见[架构文档](docs/architecture.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm test\npnpm run test:coverage\n```\n\n`pnpm test` 会构建 workspace 和公开 bundle、检查打包产物契约，并运行完整测试。Client 代码要求语句、分支、函数和行覆盖率全部达到 100%。"
    },
    {
      "section": "隐私与安全",
      "text": "- 插件不保存源码、终端输出或完整对话记录。\n- Plane API Key 每次操作时从 DSH credentials 获取。\n- 项目元数据和 Outbox 默认保存在 `~/.dsh/plugins/ambient-project/ambient.sqlite`。\n- 报告安全问题前请阅读 [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "参与贡献",
      "text": "欢迎提交贡献。发起 Pull Request 前请阅读 [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) 和[行为准则](CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE) © 2026 Wenyan Wei。"
    }
  ],
